WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.737
Costs continue to compound.

00:00:02.687 --> 00:00:11.050
To date, the financial footprint exceeds 2.2 billion dollars, representing a 611 percent budget overrun.

00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:18.037
The government allocated emergency stabilization funds, yet the fundamental architecture remains broken.
